    {
      "title": "Water is a Helper! 💧",
      "text": "Water helps us every day! We drink it, cook with it, bathe with it, wash clothes and utensils, and water plants! It is a daily helper in every home!",
      "emoji": "💧",
      "bgColor": "from-cyan-400 to-blue-500",
      "spoken": "Water helps us every day! We drink it, cook with it, bathe with it, wash clothes and utensils, and water plants!",
      "diagram": {
        "type": "water-cycle",
        "animate": true,
        "data": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "With or Without Water? 🚰",
      "text": "Some jobs need water — bathing, cooking, washing. Some jobs do NOT need water — sweeping with a broom, folding dry clothes, dusting! Can you tell the difference?",
      "emoji": "🧹",
      "bgColor": "from-blue-400 to-indigo-500",
      "spoken": "Some jobs need water like bathing, cooking, and washing. Some jobs do not need water like sweeping, folding clothes, and dusting!",
      "diagram": {
        "type": "water-cycle",
        "animate": true,
        "data": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Where Does Water Come From? 🏞️",
      "text": "Water comes from many places! Taps, wells, hand pumps, rivers, ponds, lakes, rain, and water tankers are all sources of water!",
      "emoji": "🌊",
      "bgColor": "from-teal-400 to-cyan-500",
      "spoken": "Water comes from many places! Taps, wells, hand pumps, rivers, ponds, lakes, rain, and water tankers are all sources of water!",
      "diagram": {
        "type": "water-cycle",
        "animate": true,
        "data": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Save Water! 💪",
      "text": "Fresh water is limited! Close taps tightly, use a mug for bathing, fix leaks. Do not let water overflow or run while brushing! Every drop counts!",
      "emoji": "🪣",
      "bgColor": "from-green-400 to-emerald-500",
      "spoken": "Fresh water is limited! Close taps tightly, use a mug for bathing, fix leaks. Do not let water overflow or run while brushing!",
      "diagram": {
        "type": "water-cycle",
        "animate": true,
        "data": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Reuse Water! 🔄",
      "text": "Reuse means using the same water again! Vegetable wash water can water plants. Leftover drinking water can clean tables. Washing machine water can mop floors!",
      "emoji": "🌱",
